WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.600
*romantic music*

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:06.880
Doorman: Bonjour!

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:08.680
Host: Ahhh, bonjour!

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:09.940
Your table awaits!

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:14.360
Oh, hi!

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:15.720
I've got something for you

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:16.940
A rose!

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:18.060
*sniff* Ahhh!

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:19.280
Do you– Oh!

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:19.880
Thank you!

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:21.360
Bonjour!

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:22.920
Bonsoir!

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:24.600
You look so familiar.

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:25.960
Have we met?

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:27.140
Must be destiny!

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:27.880
OH!

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:28.500
*sniff* Ahhhh

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:29.820
Good year!

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:32.160
I can't wait to get to know you.

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:33.340
But it feels like I might've –

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:34.000
Oh!

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:34.500
*Deeply inhales*

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:35.620
*sigh*

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:38.640
It feels like I might've known you for a long time.

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:40.180
But either–

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:41.680
Ohhh my!

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:42.180
okay.

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:45.000
Either way, I can't wait to see what this date has in store.

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:47.280
*intense music plays while chef slams check book on table*

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:50.420
Chef: So who's gonna pay for this?

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:52.540
Mark: *nervously* Oh I can take care of....

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:55.400
...this... okay.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:58.920
Alright.  Well, I...

00:00:59.300 --> 00:00:59.800
*Chef's breathing intensifies*

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:02.180
...must have...

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:04.000
...lost it...

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:05.600
I- okay...

00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:08.820
Maybe you could pay...?

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:09.840
...please?

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:11.460
Just once...

